{"diagnosis": "Fetch makes no progress (TRAP: no progress max_addr=0x00000000, tohost FAIL 0xdead) with the first NOP at address 0 never completing. Expected mem_la_firstword_reg to reset to 1 to mark the first lookahead word, but the excerpt resets it to 0. With last_mem_valid==0 that stale 0 is held as non-first word, stalling the mem_valid && !mem_ready handshake on the initial fetch.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -390,9 +390,9 @@
 	always @(posedge clk) begin
 		if (!resetn) begin
-			mem_la_firstword_reg <= 0;
+			mem_la_firstword_reg <= 1;
 			last_mem_valid <= 0;
 		end else begin
 			if (!last_mem_valid)
 				mem_la_firstword_reg <= mem_la_firstword;", "expected": "tohost PASS (no FAIL 0xdead), no TRAP: no progress, max_addr advances past 0x00000000"}

